          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "C"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          311.5280256734007,
          503.24060820413445,
          425.8007546296296,
          11.918604651162752
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "HAIRMAN AND C HIEF E XECUTIVE O FFICER"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          405.47550505050503,
          477.49240956072356,
          217.4890037878788,
          11.918604651162696
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "J AMES R. HOUGHTON"
      }
    ],
    [],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          551.576482881137,
          838.9986493686868,
          11.32266117571055
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We will long remember 2002 as one of the most challenging years — if not the most challenging — in Corning Incorporated’s"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          571.0439079457365,
          817.5237777356903,
          11.322661175710664
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "long history. I quickly became even more steeped in these challenges in April when, at the request of our Board of Directors,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          590.5113462532299,
          5.576726473063971,
          11.322661175710664
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "I"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          104.6673832070707,
          590.5113462532299,
          453.4563503787878,
          11.322661175710664
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "returned to the company as Chairman and Chief Executive Officer. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          625.4719773901809,
          811.2287074494948,
          11.322647932816551
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Since that time, I am increasingly convinced that, despite our downturn, the long-term future of Corning remains bright and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          644.9394024547803,
          155.42295702861952,
          11.322661175710607
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "filled with opportunity."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          679.9012916666667,
          808.7862912037036,
          11.322674418604663
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "But in the meantime, we have been living in a very difficult reality – one marked by ongoing quarterly losses and drops in"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          699.3687564599484,
          839.5396733585858,
          11.322661175710607
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "revenue. You, our shareholders—along with our employees and our friends in the communities we serve—felt the pain. We all"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          718.83622125323,
          826.0973850589224,
          11.322647932816551
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "watched our businesses retrench, battered by a weakened global economy and Wall Street turmoil. And we could only wonder"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          738.3036728036176,
          605.1839321969696,
          11.322661175710607
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "what bad news would be next as our stock value continued its seemingly relentless decline."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          773.2655752583979,
          801.3766110690235,
          11.322647932816551
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "With the severe drop-off in revenues from our telecommunications customers, we knew we could no longer afford to keep"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          792.7330268087856,
          841.4741279040403,
          11.322661175710607
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "up the costly infrastructure of facilities and staff we had in place. Put simply, we couldn’t spend more than we were making. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          827.6936711886304,
          759.1150500420874,
          11.322661175710607
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We also knew our strengths — and they were many! We knew we were not — nor had we ever been — merely a"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          847.1611227390181,
          779.3606981902356,
          11.322674418604663
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "telecommunications company. Rather, we are a technology company, with the materials and process expertise to create"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          866.6285742894057,
          750.0170534090909,
          11.322674418604663
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "life-changing products. That’s what we’ve been for all of our 152 years; that’s what we’ll continue to be. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          901.5904674741603,
          826.0481885101009,
          11.322678391472849
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "And we knew something else … that our Values, the historic strength of our company, were alive and well. Quality, Integrity,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          921.0579216731267,
          838.5561910353535,
          11.322678391472877
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Performance, Leadership, Innovation, Independence and The Individual continue to guide our every move, and continue to set us"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          94.90395795454546,
          940.5253811692506,
          830.1627869949493,
          11.322673094315263
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "apart from other companies—especially those caught in the accounting scandals that marred the business world this past year."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          509.0039562289562,
          994.7744172803617,
          7.765151515151501,
          10.726745510335913
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Times-Roman",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "1"
      }
    ]
